a">       The index being set.      </span>     </dd>             <dt><span class="parameter" style="color:#3A95FF">value</span></dt>     <dd>      <span class="simpara">       The new value for the <span class="parameter" style="color:#3A95FF">key</span>.      </span>     </dd>       </dl>   </div> <div class="refsect1 returnvalues" id="refsect1-mongodb-bson-document.offsetset-returnvalues">  <h3 class="title">返回值</h3>  <p class="simpara">   没有返回值。  </p> </div> <div class="refsect1 errors" id="refsect1-mongodb-bson-document.offsetset-errors">  <h3 class="title">错误／异常</h3>  <ul class="simplelist">   <li>Always throws a <span class="classname"><a href="https://php.net/manual/zh/class.mongodb-driver-exception-logicexception.php" class="classname">MongoDB\Driver\Exception\LogicException</a></span>.</li>  </ul> </div></div>
